!   line 48  215047.40   215127.04 00                 BD,SIPT+20.
!
! TWO LISTING MARKS, RECORDED AND NOT EXPLAINED: lines 5 and 29 print
! a "*" in the one-character column just right of the LOCATION, where
! every other row prints a blank.  printed p.103 line 48 carries the
! same mark on its CNOP.  Line 5 here is an SLC and line 29 is an
! ordinary "SIC,S T IC" identical to lines 25, 27, 31 and 33, which do
! not carry it, so the mark is not a property of the statement.
!
! THE CARD-SERIAL COLUMN IS ANOMALOUS AND IS NOT RELIED ON.  It reads
! DB000001 at line 1 -- D, not C: in the SERIAL COLUMN the straight
! vertical left stem and squared corners are unmistakable at 600 dpi.
! THE HEADER'S "CARD ID" GLYPH IS NOT INDEPENDENTLY SETTLED: it is
! read DB here by appeal to the serial column, not off its own shape,
! which at 1800 dpi could be either.  Worth knowing that
! decks/mcp_bootstrap_p104.strap records its own prefix as "CB" and
! says in so many words that it is "NOT claimed with confidence", so
! the two pages disagree and nothing in either depends on it.
! The serial column also does NOT advance once per line: DB000015, DB000024, DB000025,
! DB000026, DB000027, DB000028, DB000029 and DB000036 each appear on
! TWO consecutive lines, so 48 lines carry about 41 distinct serials.
! THE LINE COUNT IN THIS DECK COMES FROM THE PRINTED LINE-NUMBER
! COLUMN (1..48, no gap), NOT FROM THE SERIALS.  printed p.103 used
! the serial column to count its lines; on this page that method would
! have given the wrong answer, and I have no explanation for the
! repeats.

! ---- CHECKS, read by tests/verify_mcp_page.py 110 ------------------
! Only S IT is !SYM'd: it is the one symbol this page DEFINES, and
! p.103's "S IA VF,SIT" corroborates its address off the page.  The
! sixteen SYN'd names are back-derived from this page's own binary, so
! !SYM-ing them would check nothing.
!SYM   SIT      215023.00
!CHECK 215023.00 | 216411.40 80 | line 7 S IT SIC,YMFIC
!CHECK 215023.40 | 216374.04 00 | line 8 BD,YFXMK
!CHECK 215024.00 | 216411.40 80 | line 9 SIC,YMFIC
!CHECK 215024.40 | 216376.04 00 | line 10 BD,YFXIK
!CHECK 215025.00 | 216411.40 80 | line 11 SIC,YMFIC
!CHECK 215025.40 | 216400.04 00 | line 12 BD,YFXIJ
!CHECK 215026.00 | 216411.40 80 | line 13 SIC,YMFIC
!CHECK 215026.40 | 216402.04 00 | line 14 BD,YFXEK
!CHECK 215027.00 | 215265.00 80 | line 15 SIC,STIC
!CHECK 215027.40 | 215107.04 00 | line 16 BD,SIPT+4.0 - TIME SIGNAL INTERRUPT
!CHECK 215030.00 | 216411.40 80 | line 17 SIC,YMFIC
!CHECK 215030.40 | 216404.04 00 | line 18 BD,YFXCPU
!CHECK 215031.00 | 216604.00 80 | line 19 SIC,YSFIC
!CHECK 215031.40 | 216430.04 00 | line 20 BD,YFXEKJ
!CHECK 215032.00 | 216604.00 80 | line 21 SIC,YSFIC
!CHECK 215032.40 | 216432.04 00 | line 22 BD,YFXUNR
!CHECK 215033.00 | 216604.00 80 | line 23 SIC,YSFIC
!CHECK 215033.40 | 216434.04 00 | line 24 BD,YFXCBJ
!CHECK 215034.00 | 215265.00 80 | line 25 SIC,S T IC
!CHECK 215034.40 | 215114.04 00 | line 26 BD,S IPT+9.0 -EPCK INTERRUPT
!CHECK 215035.00 | 215265.00 80 | line 27 SIC,S T IC
!CHECK 215035.40 | 215115.04 00 | line 28 BD,S IPT+10.0 -UK INTERRUPT
!CHECK 215036.00 | 215265.00 80 | line 29 SIC,S T IC (location carries a "*")
!CHECK 215036.40 | 215116.04 00 | line 30 BD,S IPT+11.0 -EE INTERRUPT
!CHECK 215037.00 | 215265.00 80 | line 31 SIC,S T IC
!CHECK 215037.40 | 215117.04 00 | line 32 BD,S IPT+12.0 -EOP INTERRUPT
!CHECK 215040.00 | 215265.00 80 | line 33 SIC,S T IC
!CHECK 215040.40 | 215120.04 00 | line 34 BD,S IPT+13.0 -CS INTERRUPT
!CHECK 215041.00 | 000000.30 00 | line 35 NOP (printed "NCP")
!CHECK 215041.40 | 000000.30 00 | line 36 NOP
!CHECK 215042.00 | 216604.00 80 | line 37 SIC,YSFIC
!CHECK 215042.40 | 216436.04 00 | line 38 BD,YFXOP
!CHECK 215043.00 | 216604.00 80 | line 39 SIC,YSFIC
!CHECK 215043.40 | 216440.04 00 | line 40 BD,YFXAD
!CHECK 215044.00 | 216604.00 80 | line 41 SIC,YSFIC
!CHECK 215044.40 | 216442.04 00 | line 42 BD,YFXUSA
!CHECK 215045.00 | 215265.00 80 | line 43 SIC,ST IC
!CHECK 215045.40 | 215125.04 00 | line 44 BD,SIPT+18.
!CHECK 215046.00 | 216604.00 80 | line 45 SIC,YSFIC
!CHECK 215046.40 | 216444.04 00 | line 46 BD,YFXDS
!CHECK 215047.00 | 215265.00 80 | line 47 SIC,ST IC
!CHECK 215047.40 | 215127.04 00 | line 48 BD,SIPT+20.
